WEBVTT

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.740
on the last episode of Dragon Ball Z.

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:05.890
I'm getting a terrible feeling.

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:10.000
The Supreme Kai's darkest fears were realized

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.420
when the seal around Majin Buu's shell was broken

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:14.460
and the doomsday creature materialized

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:16.500
out of a strange cloud of smoke.

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:21.670
With his childlike behavior, Buu seemed harmless

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:24.110
to young Gohan, but the Supreme Kai knew better.

00:01:24.370 --> 00:01:27.250
Any doubts about Buu's true power would soon disappear.

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:32.310
taunting Dabura. The powerful

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:34.230
king of the demon world had insulted

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:36.270
Boo, unimpressed by the state of

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:38.470
the new arrival. And with the greatest

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:40.170
of ease, Boo gave Dabura

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:42.130
a one-way ticket into a

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:43.610
distant cliff wall.

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:47.280
Did you see the way he bounced?

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:49.060
But rather than getting upset about

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:51.140
losing his right-hand man, Bobbity

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:53.240
was ecstatic. For an evil wizard

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:55.100
without loyalties, it was merely

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:56.660
a changing of the guard.

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:59.020
With Majin Boo's superior strength

00:01:59.020 --> 00:01:59.960
confirmed, go...

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:04.630
And the Supreme Kai made a desperate escape, for they had become Buu's next target.

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:08.690
The chase began, and Gohan was confident he could buy them time to regroup.

00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:12.590
But Buu revealed another of his talents, Unmatchable Speed.

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:18.010
And with one mighty blow, Gohan was out.

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:27.470
While it seemed Goku had persuaded Vegeta to postpone their fight and stop Majin Buu.

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:33.430
Tempered Saiyan Prince once again preyed upon Goku's trust.

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:36.410
Vowing to destroy Buu without any help,

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:40.090
he has knocked Goku unconscious and taken the last Senzu Bean.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:42.230
But there's a more pressing concern.

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:47.370
The Supreme Kai is all alone and face-to-face with his greatest fear.

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:17.720
Jimbo!

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:18.950
Is that...

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:01.020
Pah!

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:01.870
Pah!

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:57.800
But you all seem to be in a great amount of...

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.700
What terrible misfortune!

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:02.000
Thank you.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.130
Maybe I should be polite and put him out of his misery.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:35.060
Ha, ha, ha!

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:36.720
No!

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:44.620
It's me, Supreme Kai! Let's get out of here!

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:51.860
and was just getting fun.

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:14.370
His skin just absorbs everything I throw at him.

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:20.690
Get down for it.

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:34.900
You

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:36.770
You're headed straight into August...

00:09:59.270 --> 00:09:59.710
you there.

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:05.580
You didn't do something tricky now, did you?

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.710
You have to keep on living, Gohan.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:17.170
You could be our only hope.

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:30.940
All right.

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:33.610
So the guys from the Cell games are back.

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:35.090
Well, a few of them.

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:35.700
Perfect.

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:37.900
Where all those other weirdos come from?

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:41.970
And why was my Vidal acting so chubby with that pretty boy?

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:44.570
He had the nerve to go off and start flying.

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:48.510
Which means he must be some kind of trickster or some evil alien.

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:53.740
Oh, and Vidal is absolutely not allowed to go out with evil alien boys!

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:03.030
Hold a second! It doesn't add up here!

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:03.750
Huh?

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:09.520
If only tricksters and aliens can fly, then how was my daughter up in the air with them?

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:12.560
Hey, understand it?

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:16.080
Human beings must have been capable of flying all along!

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:19.530
Obviously, it's just a matter of sufficient upper body strength.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:22.620
So, of course, the world champion can do it no sweat!

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.780
Alright, here I go!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:33.720
Mm-hmm.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:38.170
It's kinda cold out there!

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:50.200
Hmhmhmhmhmhmhmhmhmhmhmhmhm

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:52.970
Those know-nothing losers think they're so cool,

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:54.790
