00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:04.640
let one of my slaves do the dirty work but to show you my appreciation I think

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:09.640
I'll do it myself see what a marvelous circle this is you defeat my father and

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:22.980
I defeat you get the circle hey boo what do you say you take care of this

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:25.960
pass from me like you were supposed to do in the first place oh

